{
  "_comment": [
    "Every candidate considered, in one place, so the same harness runs on this",
    "laptop and on a server without editing code. `vram_fp16_gb` is weights only:",
    "params x 2 bytes. Encoding needs headroom on top of that, which preflight.py",
    "applies as `overhead` rather than burying it in the number.",
    "",
    "`status` is the truth as of 2026-08-17 and is checked, not assumed —",
    "see 00-FINDINGS-before-harness.md for how."
  ],
  "overhead": 1.25,

